{
  "info": {
    "name": "Rent-2.0 API",
    "description": "Локальная коллекция для Rent-2.0.\n\nПеременная коллекции `base_url` по умолчанию `http://localhost:3000`.\n\nПримеры тел POST:\n\n**POST /api/v1/clients**\n```json\n{\n  \"first_name\": \"Test\",\n  \"last_name\": \"User\",\n  \"phone\": \"+79990000000\",\n  \"role\": \"CLIENT\"\n}\n```\n\n**POST /api/v1/items** (подставьте реальный `owner_id` из ответа создания клиента)\n```json\n{\n  \"owner_id\": \"UUID_СУЩЕСТВУЮЩЕГО_КЛИЕНТА\",\n  \"title\": \"Горные лыжи\",\n  \"description\": \"Описание...\",\n  \"price_hour\": 300,\n  \"price_weekend\": 500\n}\n```\n\n**POST /api/v1/bookings**\n```json\n{\n  \"client_id\": \"UUID_КЛИЕНТА\",\n  \"item_id\": \"UUID_ВЕЩИ\",\n  \"start_at\": \"2026-04-15T03:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"end_at\": \"2026-04-15T09:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"total_price\": 300\n}\n```\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Clients",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List clients",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/clients"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create client",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Test\",\n  \"last_name\": \"User\",\n  \"phone\": \"+79990000000\",\n  \"role\": \"CLIENT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/clients"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Items",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List items",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/items"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"owner_id\": \"REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_UUID\",\n  \"title\": \"Горные лыжи\",\n  \"description\": \"Описание\",\n  \"price_hour\": 300,\n  \"price_weekend\": 500\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/items"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bookings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List bookings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/bookings"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create booking",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"client_id\": \"REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_UUID\",\n  \"item_id\": \"REPLACE_WITH_ITEM_UUID\",\n  \"start_at\": \"2026-04-15T03:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"end_at\": \"2026-04-15T09:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"total_price\": 300\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/bookings"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
